'''Meowin' in the Rain''' (土砂降りに唄えば, ''Doshaburi ni Utaeba'', '''Singing in the Downpour''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

